@startwbs
' Incident cause tree (STYLE rule 18): the problem on top, cause categories below it (data,
' process, tooling, people), each leaf a cause that cites its evidence (ticket, log, query).
' Fault-tree variant: a gate node's text starts "AND:" or "OR:", styled <<gate>> (a <<AND>> stereotype would not print).
' Edit below the end marker. Elbow lines by construction; no fishbone diagonals.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
wbsDiagram {
  .data { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
  .process { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
  .tooling { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
  .people { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
  .failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
  .gate { BackgroundColor #FFFFFF; LineThickness 2 }
}
</style>
' house-preamble-end

title Cause tree for <incident> (as-of date)

* Replace: the problem, as observed <<failure>>
** Data <<data>>
*** Replace: cause\n//evidence: ticket or log line//
*** Replace: second cause\n//evidence: query result//
** Process <<process>>
*** Replace: cause\n//evidence: runbook step//
*** Replace: second cause\n//evidence: query result//
** Tooling <<tooling>>
*** Replace: cause\n//evidence: alert or query//
*** Replace: second cause\n//evidence: query result//
** People <<people>>
*** Replace: cause\n//evidence: not stated//
*** Replace: second cause\n//evidence: query result//

legend bottom
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  |<#FADBD8>| the problem |
  |<#E3F2FD>| data cause |
  |<#E8F5E9>| process cause |
  |<#FFF3E0>| tooling cause |
  |<#F3E5F5>| people cause |
  | //italic line// | the evidence for the cause |
endlegend
@endwbs
